        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion J5, Scroll Grab French Colonial Egg and Dart Handleset</b> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmbellished with the quiet refinement of French Colonial architecture, Fusion Hardware's handleset is a great way to add an elegance to any home. The simple, yet sophisticated design will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. It is made even more ornate by the addition of a scrolled grab. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 5 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Solid Brass Fusion J5 Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion J5 Egg and Dart Scroll Grab Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Height: 17-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Height 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The Deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and a turn knob on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg and Dart Scroll Grab Handleset, Fusion J5",
                "description": "Scroll Grab French Colonial Egg and Dart  Fusion J5 - Embellished with the quiet refinement of French Colonial architecture, Fusion Hardware's handleset is a great way to add an elegance to any home. The simple, yet sophisticated design will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. It is made even more ornate by the addition of a scrolled grab. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 5 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
